- Hit three-dots on the right-hand side to Download ZIP
- Unzip and navigate in
- Right-click on RunAnw.bat and select "Run as Administrator"
- Follow the prompts
-----

* Delete a line from the app list in `F8ForSafeMode.ps1` to keep that app installed.
* Delete a file from `RegFiles/` to skip that tweak.
* Safe to re-run any time.

Advanced - run F8ForSafeMode.ps1 directly in an elevated PowerShell window (instead of RunAnw.bat) if you need:
* -VibeCheck to check what's actually applied without changing anything
* -ThisPCIsGenuinelyMine to skip the managed-device check (only if you're sure this is your machine)
